    "['cfm enable', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management\\n##\\n\\nThe `cfm enable` command in Huawei enables Connectivity Fault Management (CFM) globally. The equivalent Juniper command is `set protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management`, which activates CFM at the protocol level.', 'trans_template': 'set protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management'}]]": 1,
